@startuml

' PIXEL-T Sequence Diagram - Sign Out (Final Version v3)
' Style: mengikuti sequence_diagram_sign_out_contoh.png
' Content: akurat berdasarkan implementasi PIXEL-T aktual
' Folder: references/bab 4/
' Tidak ada backend logout endpoint; supabase.auth.signOut() dipanggil via Auth Service.
' Error dari logout diabaikan oleh AuthContext; navigasi eksplisit navigate('/login').

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
skinparam boxPadding 10
skinparam roundCorner 0
hide footbox

skinparam actor {
    BorderColor black
    BackgroundColor white
    FontColor black
}

skinparam participant {
    BorderColor black
    BackgroundColor white
    FontColor black
}

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ActorBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    BoxBorderColor black
}

actor "Pengguna" as User
participant "AppShell" as AppShell
participant "AuthContext" as AuthContext
participant "Auth Service\nlogoutUser()" as AuthService
participant "Supabase Auth" as Supabase

== Inisialisasi Modal Konfirmasi ==
User -> AppShell : Klik "Sign Out"\n(dropdown avatar)
activate AppShell
AppShell -> User : Tampilkan modal konfirmasi
deactivate AppShell

note right of User
  Modal: "Are you sure you want to sign out?"
  "You will need to sign in again..."
  Tombol: [No]  [Yes]
end note

== Konfirmasi & Proses Logout ==
User -> AppShell : Klik "Yes"
activate AppShell
AppShell -> AppShell : confirmSignOut()\nsetIsSigningOut(true)
AppShell -> AuthContext : signOut()
activate AuthContext
AuthContext -> AuthService : logoutUser()
activate AuthService
AuthService -> Supabase : supabase.auth.signOut()
activate Supabase
Supabase --> AuthService : { error: string | null }
deactivate Supabase
AuthService -> AuthService : formatAuthError()\njika error
AuthService --> AuthContext : { error: null } atau { error }
deactivate AuthService
AuthContext -> AuthContext : setUser(null)\nsetSession(null)\n(error diabaikan)
deactivate AuthContext
AppShell -> AppShell : setIsSignOutOpen(false)\nnavigate('/login', { replace: true })
deactivate AppShell
AppShell -> User : Arahkan ke halaman /login

== Sinkronisasi State (Listener) ==
note right of AuthContext
  onAuthStateChange listener:
  Terima session=null dari Supabase
  setSession(null)
  setUser(null)
  (Sinkronisasi kedua)
end note

@enduml